Entity.notes:
[DE_ENTI_COMMENT[
IT_System, Betriebssystem, Infrastruktur in oder auf dem Anwendungen laufen können.  Beispiele: Power-DNS JRE java runtime environment Windows Android ubuntu Linux mongo-DB Excel Access SAP-Hana IDE  = Application for IT-People Eclipse / Microsoft Studio Jenkins Oracle-APEX 
]DE_ENTI_COMMENT]
[EN_ENTI_COMMENT[
IT_System, operating system, infrastructure in or on which applications can run.  Examples: Power-DNS JRE java runtime environment Windows Android ubuntu Linux mongo-DB Excel Access SAP-Hana IDE = Application for IT-People Eclipse / Microsoft Studio Jenkins Oracle-APEX
]EN_ENTI_COMMENT]

